{"2565340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Split Echo: Demo", "steam_appid": 2565340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This is a shortened version of our upcoming game <i>Split Echo</i>. If you enjoy this game, consider adding <i>Split Echo </i>to your steam wishlist! <strong><u>Split Echo is a Co-op only game, two players require their own copy of the game. The game also relies on communicating with each other.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an experience designed to challenge you and your partner. Progress only happens when both players actively use their brains together. The puzzles evolve from deceptively simple to deeply complex, demanding real teamwork. Expect moments of clarity, moments of chaos, and the occasional urge to blame your partner’s communication skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/9651aa5c8c8b0831ca57774436ff1874.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/9651aa5c8c8b0831ca57774436ff1874.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/9651aa5c8c8b0831ca57774436ff1874.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Unique path</u>: You and your partner can choose between two distinct paths, each offering a different perspective. Combine your thinking and communicate effectively to progress through the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/4c5ae6316d3b0693faa7da8539c23038.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/4c5ae6316d3b0693faa7da8539c23038.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/4c5ae6316d3b0693faa7da8539c23038.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Items:</u> Look for clues in everything you see. What seems insignificant might be the key to your puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/a2288b2a06efb544131d4ef24a7af1ca.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/a2288b2a06efb544131d4ef24a7af1ca.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/a2288b2a06efb544131d4ef24a7af1ca.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Send Items</u>: you and your partner can send items to each other. This can be important to solving a puzzle, or simply to send them a gift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/329099c0cf7807af5b084b86a54b7235.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=1170 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/329099c0cf7807af5b084b86a54b7235.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/329099c0cf7807af5b084b86a54b7235.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Solve Puzzles</u>: Puzzles will require good communication between you and your partner. Puzzles will start simple and get more complex as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This is a shortened version of our upcoming game <i>Split Echo</i>. If you enjoy this game, consider adding <i>Split Echo </i>to your steam wishlist! <strong><u>Split Echo is a Co-op only game, two players require their own copy of the game. The game also relies on communicating with each other.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an experience designed to challenge you and your partner. Progress only happens when both players actively use their brains together. The puzzles evolve from deceptively simple to deeply complex, demanding real teamwork. Expect moments of clarity, moments of chaos, and the occasional urge to blame your partner’s communication skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/9651aa5c8c8b0831ca57774436ff1874.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/9651aa5c8c8b0831ca57774436ff1874.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/9651aa5c8c8b0831ca57774436ff1874.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Unique path</u>: You and your partner can choose between two distinct paths, each offering a different perspective. Combine your thinking and communicate effectively to progress through the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/4c5ae6316d3b0693faa7da8539c23038.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/4c5ae6316d3b0693faa7da8539c23038.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/4c5ae6316d3b0693faa7da8539c23038.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Items:</u> Look for clues in everything you see. What seems insignificant might be the key to your puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/a2288b2a06efb544131d4ef24a7af1ca.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/a2288b2a06efb544131d4ef24a7af1ca.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/a2288b2a06efb544131d4ef24a7af1ca.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Send Items</u>: you and your partner can send items to each other. This can be important to solving a puzzle, or simply to send them a gift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/329099c0cf7807af5b084b86a54b7235.poster.avif?t=1769978515\" width=1170 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/329099c0cf7807af5b084b86a54b7235.webm?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/extras/329099c0cf7807af5b084b86a54b7235.mp4?t=1769978515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Solve Puzzles</u>: Puzzles will require good communication between you and your partner. Puzzles will start simple and get more complex as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Two minds. Two perspectives. One solution. Step into a cooperative puzzle experience where you and your partner see different sides of the same world. Communicate, connect the clues, uncover the truth.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/1bba89843475c101e5668f8492f4077de895f00c/header.jpg?t=1769978515", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/29208e145199f5c6c78f99f635d91e38036a1bd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769978515", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565340/29208e145199f5c6c78f99f635d91e38036a1bd5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769978515", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *